  Utilities                                                                     
  No desktop theme switch is available here: no GNOME, KDE or macOS session.    
  Change the dotfiles theme opens the list of complete themes.                  
  WSL resources are not adjustable here: .wslconfig is a Windows file, and      
  Linux is not WSL.                                                             
  Measure the shell's startup times zsh -i -c exit; it changes nothing.         
  Report the terminal capabilities reads the colour depth and OSC 52.           
  Check the machine against the last install reports which recorded paths are   
  gone.                                                                         
  Diagnose the network runs read-only checks, stage by stage.                   
                                                                                
